---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import {
	LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL,
	LICENSE_PATH,
	SITE_BRAND,
	TERMS_PATH,
} from '../../lib/seo';
---

<LegalLayout
	title="Refund Policy"
	description="iStockVisual.com refunds: 7-day no-questions-asked on 6-Month, 12-Month, and Lifetime; 1-Month and short passes refund only if unused."
	heading="Refund Policy"
	lede="Refund rules follow the plan. Long-term Pro includes a 7-day trial even after downloads. Short passes and 1-Month refund only if you have not taken library images after paying."
>
	<h2>1. Overview</h2>
	<p>
		This policy covers paid access to 2K / 4K / 8K library downloads on {SITE_BRAND}. Free 512 and
		1K downloads do not involve a charge. Eligibility:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>6-Month Pro, 12-Month Pro, and Lifetime Access</strong> — 7-day trial. No-questions-asked
			refund within 7 days of purchase, even if you downloaded HD images or used Pro editor export.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>1-Month Pro</strong> — 3-day trial. Refund only if you have not downloaded any library
			images after paying.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>1-Day Pass and 7-Day Pass</strong> — refund only if unused (no library image downloads
			after purchase). No calendar money-back window.
		</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		This policy is in addition to any rights you have under consumer law. Those rights are not
		limited by this page. Current prices: <a href="/price">Pricing</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>2. 6-Month, 12-Month, and Lifetime Access — 7-day trial</h2>
	<p>
		These Long-Term plans include a 7-day trial from purchase. During those 7 days you may request a
		full refund for any reason — including if you already took 2K / 4K / 8K files or used Expand on
		a library asset.
	</p>
	<p>
		After the 7-day trial ends, we do not refund change of mind, unused time, or a plan that has
		already been used, except where applicable law requires otherwise. Lifetime Access is not a
		subscription; after the trial it is not prorated.
	</p>

	<h2>3. 1-Month Pro — 3-day trial</h2>
	<p>
		1-Month Pro includes a 3-day trial from purchase. During those 3 days you may request a full
		refund only if you have not downloaded any library images after paying (any size after that
		purchase counts).
	</p>
	<p>
		After the 3-day trial ends, or after any library image download during the trial, the month plan
		is not refundable.
	</p>

	<h2>4. 1-Day Pass and 7-Day Pass</h2>
	<p>
		These short passes do not include a calendar money-back window. You may request a full refund
		only if you have not downloaded any library images after purchase. A single download voids the
		refund, even if time remains on the pass.
	</p>
	<p>
		Downloads you made as a free member (512 / 1K) before that paid purchase do not count against a
		1-Day, 7-Day, or 1-Month refund.
	</p>

	<h2>5. What does not by itself create a refund</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Using studio tools on your own files (no library download)</li>
		<li>Opening a preview, copying a prompt, or copying attribution text</li>
		<li>Visual search uploads</li>
		<li>Disliking a particular generated scene after an HD download on a short pass (that download is use)</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>6. How to request a refund</h2>
	<p>
		Email <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> from the address on
		your account. Include:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>The email on the account</li>
		<li>The plan you bought (for example 1-Day Pass, 1-Month Pro, or Lifetime Access)</li>
		<li>The approximate purchase date</li>
		<li>A short note if something went wrong (optional)</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		For Long-Term plans, request within 7 days. For 1-Month Pro, request within 3 days and only if
		unused. We aim to confirm eligible requests promptly and to return funds by the original payment
		method. Do not send card numbers in email.
	</p>

	<h2>7. What happens after a refund</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Pro / pass access on that purchase ends when the refund is issued</li>
		<li>You can still use the site as a free member, including 512 and 1K downloads and the studio tools</li>
		<li>
			Files you already downloaded remain usable under the
			<a href={LICENSE_PATH}>CC0 License</a>
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>8. When we do not refund</h2>
	<p>Except where applicable law requires otherwise, we do not refund:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>6-Month, 12-Month, or Lifetime Access after the 7-day trial</li>
		<li>1-Month Pro after the 3-day trial, or after any library image download following that purchase</li>
		<li>A 1-Day or 7-Day Pass after any library image download following that purchase</li>
		<li>Change of mind, unused time, or an expired plan once the applicable trial or unused-only rule has ended</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>9. Chargebacks and abuse</h2>
	<p>
		If you believe a charge is wrong, contact us first. Filing a chargeback without contacting us
		may delay resolution. We may refuse or claw back a goodwill refund, and may suspend accounts,
		where we see repeated refund abuse, payment fraud, or automated download abuse. See the
		<a href={TERMS_PATH}>Terms of Use</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>10. Contact</h2>
	<p>
		Refund questions for {SITE_BRAND}:
		<a href={`mailto:${LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
	</p>
</LegalLayout>
